        "original_id": "3c18b615-e4aa-5846-b194-dfa799c2ee06",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Fairview, Quezon City, EDSA, Ortigas Avenue\n- Companies: Robinsons Malls\n- Products: Robinsons Novaliches, Robinsons Galleria, SM Megamall\n- Concepts: shopping malls, mixed-use complexes\n\nFacts:\n- Robinsons Novaliches was formerly known as Robinsons Place Novaliches and Robinsons Nova Market.\n- Robinsons Novaliches is a shopping mall in Fairview.\n- Robinsons Novaliches is owned and operated by Robinsons Malls.\n- Robinsons Malls is the second largest mall operator in the Philippines.\n- Robinsons Galleria is also known as Robinsons Galleria Ortigas.\n- Robinsons Galleria is a mixed-use complex and shopping mall at EDSA corner Ortigas Avenue in Quezon City.\n- Robinsons Galleria is located near SM Megamall.",
